# parley-launcher programs 1
# The Parley programs "parley add NAME" knows by name, one a line:
#   NAME | GROUP:ARTIFACT | MAIN CLASS (empty: the jar's own) | what it is
fsh                    | us.bringardner:fsh                              |                                              | The fsh shell
fshdb                  | us.bringardner:fshdb                            |                                              | The fsh script debugger (command line)
fshstudio              | us.bringardner:parley-fsh-studio                |                                              | Fsh Studio: edit, run and debug fsh scripts
pssh                   | us.bringardner.parley:parley-ssh                |                                              | The Parley SSH client
pfiles                 | us.bringardner.parley:parley-files-viewer       |                                              | Parley Files: the files viewer
pfv                    | us.bringardner.parley:parley-files-viewer-tui   |                                              | The Parley files viewer for a terminal
